  title="Saline Criminal Defense | Law Offices of Joseph A. Simon"
  description="If you're facing DUI/OWI charges in Saline, trust the over 38 years of experience of local attorney Joseph A. Simon to protect your rights and guide you through the legal process. Contact us today."
>
