        <p class="text-[18px] sm:text-[21px] text-[#C3CCDA] leading-[1.75] mt-7 max-w-[900px]" data-ps="src/pages/service-areas/saline.astro:hl57p0">If you're facing DUI/OWI charges in Saline, trust the over 38 years of experience of local attorney Joseph A. Simon to protect your rights and guide you through the legal process. Contact us today.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-9" data-ps="src/pages/service-areas/saline.astro:r44myk">
          <a href="#contact" class="bg-[#732521] text-white px-7 py-4 rounded-[3px] font-bold" data-ps="src/pages/service-areas/saline.astro:aaa7fa">Confidential Consultation</a>
          <a href="tel:+17348876200" class="border border-white/30 text-white px-7 py-4 rounded-[3px] font-bold" data-ps="src/pages/service-areas/saline.astro:aaa7f9">(734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#C3CCDA] text-[14px] mt-6" data-ps="src/pages/service-areas/saline.astro:6b1doj">Ann Arbor office · Serving Saline</p>
      </div>
    </section>

